@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam dpi 300

package "Nounce Application" {
  component "Web Client\n(React Frontend\nTanStack Start)" as Client

  component "Application Server\n(API Endpoints\nBusiness Logic\nTanStack Start Server)" as Server

  component "ML Worker\n(POWSM + LoRA adapter\nPhone Recognition\nCTC Forced Alignment\nVAD Abstention\nFeature Diff + GOP)" as GPU

  component "Database\n(PostgreSQL\nUser Data\nReferences + Timings\nAnalysis Results)" as DB

  component "Object Storage\n(Cloudflare R2\nUser + Reference Audio)" as Storage
}

' Connections
Client --> Server : HTTP/HTTPS
Server --> DB : SQL Queries
Server --> Storage : File Operations
Server --> GPU : ML Job Queue (single endpoint)
GPU --> Storage : Read Audio
GPU --> DB : Store Results

note right of GPU
  Single stateless endpoint.
  Processes audio asynchronously
  via the job queue. Phone
  Recognition (PR) for every task.
end note

note right of Storage
  16-bit, 16 kHz mono WAV.
  Reference phones + timings are
  precomputed offline and stored
  in the database, not recomputed.
end note

@enduml
